@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
autonumber
participant "DiagnosticTester" as T
participant "Diagnostic Management" as DM
participant "Fusion" as F
participant "SmControl" as SC
participant "CameraDriver" as CD
T -> DM : DoIP: vehicle identification, routing activation
T -> DM : 0x22 01 01
DM -> F : Read
F --> DM : "1.1.0"
DM --> T : 0x62 01 01 31 2E 31 2E 30 20 20 20
T -> DM : 0x10 03
DM --> T : 0x50 03 (P2, P2*)
T -> DM : 0x27 01
DM -> SC : GetSeed
DM --> T : 0x67 01 seed
T -> DM : 0x27 02 key
DM -> SC : CompareKey
SC --> DM : kKeyValid
DM --> T : 0x67 02
T -> DM : 0x31 01 02 01
DM -> CD : Start
DM --> T : 0x71 01 02 01
loop every second, with 0x3E 80 in between
T -> DM : 0x31 03 02 01
DM -> CD : RequestResult
DM --> T : 0x71 03 02 01 status
end
T -> DM : 0x11 01
DM -> SC : RequestReset(kHardReset)
DM --> T : 0x51 01
DM -> SC : ExecuteReset
SC -> SC : request Reset (3) from HpcController
@enduml
